  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Sustainable and Clean Energy Access Transformation in Lesotho</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to increase energy access in Lesotho.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will finance grid extensions and last mile connections to electrify households in selected villages throughout Lesotho, a distributed renewable energy pilot program to electrify households that are beyond the reach of the national grid, and include the provision of technical assistance and project management support.</narrative>
  </description>
